NEARS-2476 AC1 — rapid RTL<->LTR + text-scale 1.3x<->1.0x toggle, iPhone 17e simulator
(UDID 6D3CEFF6-D3A8-4697-89E0-27F45F1AD48D, iOS 26.5), StoreCardWidget card width
370pt (device logical width 390pt; NOT the ticket's 320dp -- Android pool was
saturated by 4 foreign live sessions after a bounded poll, see envelope drift[]).

Mechanism: Get.updateLocale(...) via Dart VM-service `evaluate` (ar_SA <-> en_US)
back-to-back with `xcrun simctl ui <udid> content_size extra-extra-extra-large|medium`
(drives the app's live clamped textScaler to exactly 1.3 / 1.0 -- confirmed via
MediaQuery.textScalerOf(Get.context!).scale(1.0) == 1.3), issued with NO settle time
between calls (raw back-to-back eval, matching "toggled in immediate succession, no
idle screen" from the ticket).

