overflow_immediate/overflow_settled = count of the literal "OVERFLOWING" suffix
RenderFlex appends (rendering/flex.dart) in `ext.flutter.debugDumpRenderTree`,
read immediately after the toggle sequence and again 1.5s later. Positive-control
(oracle-is-alive check, NEARS-1875 QA technique): the SAME dump carried 242
RenderFlex nodes and 30 StoreCardWidget mentions at the time of the 0-count reads
-- the 0 is a real "scanned and found none", not a vacuous empty dump.

Full-session app log (`/tmp/nears2476_ios_run.log`, ~510 lines across the whole QA
session incl. all 6 reps + 3 steady states + the Bengali advisory check):
  grep -ic "overflow" -> 0 matches, whole file.

